OL,3,GNEWSALottery grant 'hugely important'
OL,4,Afor closed museum
OL,5,
OL,6,FA lottery grant worth almost #200,000
OL,7,Fhas been hailed as "hugely important"
OL,8,Ffor the future of a museum that has
OL,9,Fbeen closed for three years.
OL,11,FNorth Northamptonshire Council said the
OL,12,F#196,896 National Lottery Heritage Fund
OL,13,Faward would help it safeguard Manor
OL,14,FHouse Museum in Kettering and appoint a
OL,15,Fcollections manager.
OL,17,FThe role will oversee the day-to-day
OL,18,Fcare and management of the museum's
OL,19,Fitems, while a new masterplan will
OL,20,Fguide its long-term development.
OL,23,APub: 17-OctQppppppppppppppppppppppG1/2
OL,24,ANext PageBC Eng (E) NewsCReg TVFWeather
