OL,3,GNEWSALottery grant 'hugely important'
OL,4,Afor closed museum
OL,5,
OL,6,FCouncillor Greg Wilcox said: "We know
OL,7,Fthere have been a lot of questions
OL,8,Flocally about the future of Kettering
OL,9,Fmuseum and this announcement is a
OL,10,Fhugely important step".
